    ...text(r'Everything that runs a command uses argv lists, never a shell string, and every crate name, feature name and package name from the network or from a file is validated before it reaches one. That sentence is in the code comments of all three modules, and tests in the repository try hostile names such as --git, -p, $(x) and ../x.'),
