    ...text(r'Load it with ft = "rust" (as above) or event = "VeryLazy", not only on the commands, if you want the hint and the code actions while you edit: they come from language clients started by setup(). :CrateFeatures and the fix key work as soon as the plugin is loaded. Both sibling plugins are required (xyno-imports.nvim only while the add or import module is on): setup() checks for them and, if one is missing, prints a single line that names it and starts nothing.'),
