    ...text(r'The plugin is tested on Linux by the specs of this repository and by CI. The Windows guards of the original code are kept, but the README says plainly that this repository gives no evidence for them: in xynovim’s CI the Windows job passed overall (run 39673715062), but the live rust-analyzer flows of the hint, code action and import specs failed or hung there as a known issue. macOS: nothing is tested here, and the macOS runs in xynovim’s CI were not stable. The specs mark such cases with H.known_issue so that a skip prints its reason instead of hiding.'),
