    ...text(r'The runner starts one headless Neovim per spec file. Most tests are hermetic: temporary workspaces with path-only dependencies, stubbed pickers, a stubbed crates.io client and a faked cargo add. A few go all the way: crates.io plus cargo add itoa plus cargo check, a real snacks.nvim picker (XYNO_SNACKS_DIR), a real rust-analyzer importing uuid::Uuid into a project that had no dependencies. Those skip with a printed reason when the network, cargo, rust-analyzer or the registry crates are not there.'),
